246 0 obj<</Subj(Text Box)/Type/Annot/P 239 0 R/F 4/C[1 1 1]/CreationDate(D:20250912160121-10'00')/T(mchun)/Subtype/FreeText/BS<</W 1/S/S/Type/Border>>/DA(0 0.5019608 0 rg /Helv 12 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica 12pt; text-align:left; margin:3pt; line-height:13.8pt; color:#008000)/M(D:20250912160149-10'00')/AP<</N 240 0 R>>/Rect[128.8007 379.3424 451.2938 629.8505]/NM(JKZYJXDJEBBKIPFO)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" style="font:Helvetica 12pt; text-align:left; margin:3pt; line-height:13.8pt; color:#008000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Scott Mercer,brings over 20 years of experience as a senior analyst and instructor with PdM, and he holds the highest certifications in the field; including a current ISO Category 4 certification \(attached\). He\220s performed similar tests for Hawaii County Department of Water Supply, Oahu\220s Board of Water Supply, and various contractors across the islands, including work at Kailua WWTP and Sand Island.</p><p> </p><p>We\220ve also supported projects as subcontractors for Hawaii Engineering, Hensel Phelps, and others, meeting similar FAT testing requirements using SKF Vibration Analyzers and Sensors. These are at least equivalent to the analyzers listed in the specs you provided, and more than sufficient for the testing needed</p><p /></body>)/Contents<>>>
